===== global
alias -> global
lambda in an alias -> nonlocal
comprehension in an alias -> ['nonlocal']
generator in an alias -> ['nonlocal']
bound -> global
default -> global
annotations of a generic method -> {'a': 'global', 'return': 'global'}
annotations of a method -> {'a': 'global'}
in a method -> nonlocal
bound of a class inside -> global
annotations of a class inside -> {'y': 'nonlocal'}
bound of a generic alias -> global
value of a generic alias -> global
annotations of the class -> {'attr': 'global'}
in the body -> global
comprehension in the body -> ['nonlocal']
lambda in the body -> nonlocal
the module's -> global
