===== names that are mangled
names of the parameters -> ['__T']
bound -> __X
default -> __X
lambda in a base -> __X
lambda in a lambda -> __X
comprehension -> ['__X']
generator -> ['__X']
lambda that names the parameter -> __T
comprehension that names the parameter -> ['__T']
a parameter of a lambda -> ('__X', ('__a',))
dict comprehension -> [('__X', '__X')]
in the body -> mangled for Y
lambda in the body -> mangled for Y
the parameter in the body -> __T
alias in the body -> mangled for Y
generic alias in the body -> (['__U'], 'mangled for Y', ['__U', 'mangled for Y', '__T'])
generic method -> (['__V'], 'mangled for Y', {'a': 'mangled for Y', 'return': '__V'}, ['mangled for Y', '__T', '__V'])
annotations -> {'ann': 'mangled for Y'}
co_names of a lambda in a base -> ('__X',)
in a function -> ('__Z', '__Z', '__T', ('__Z',), ('_W__T',))
